e owed  in fact the tournament was cancelled  unless all the teams agreed  to being paid up to 90 days after the  tournament ended  and they all agreed so we called an  urgent meeting with all the players and  told them about the situation that's why  we got the whole delay thing today  and we also invited the ceo of  the gaming resorts so he talked with  them  and the final decision is to continue  the games and players will  sign a contract with exclusively the  gaming resorts  for that matter and after a few matches  were cut short due to time constraints  kinguin ended up winning the tournament  and walked away with a 90-day iou for 30  000 despite the promises from bullock no  prize money was  ever actually paid out the gaming  resorts filed for bankruptcy and bullock  disappeared he i remember he said  something about it he said like  this is by far the best tournament ever  and then he ended everything in like  hail satan or something he said  something like that it was so  weird and he was like signing papers  left and right  left and right about everyone is getting  money  but much more money and blah blah blah  like he just disappeared  he did however give the daily dot one  more quote for  everyone to remember him by it was my  first event he said  and i still did much better than anybody  around  bullock's inexperience turned his  dreamhack-esque fantasy into a  laughing stock gaming.rs was left to  clean up the mess  they helped teams get their players to  dubai for the invitational they helped  players get their passports back  they pretty much cleaned up everything  they possibly could have  their ceo even did a reddit ama where he  answered any question that he could  gaming paradise is without question the  worst plan  ever it had everything busted computers  seized passports a literal  act of god you couldn't write a more  perfect  disaster esports production has come a  long way in the last couple of years  so remember next time you're complaining